        {
            "type": "title",
            "text": "Creating new dialogues\nbetween threads and metal"
        },
        {
            "type": "content",
            "side": "left",
            "label": "About Me",
            "description": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Valentina’s work plays around the surprise of what is possible to make with a simple and thin line: a thread.",
                    "spans": []
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Coming from a family with a strong feminine tailoring tradition, she wanted to bring this passionate root into her jewellery world, finding new ways of working with textiles.",
                    "spans": []
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "She weaves freely thousands of meters of threads on a hydrosoluble fabric, cutting or interlacing them one with the other, to let unexpected connections appear.",
                    "spans": []
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Her approach is both experimental and traditional: she likes to combine contemporary methods with ancient techniques, like Filigree.",
                    "spans": []
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The latest work was chosen by the “Triennale Design Museum” in Milan to be part of the exhibition “W. Women in Italian design” (April 2016- February 2017).",
                    "spans": []
                }
            ],
            "image": {
                "src": "/floema/images/f6de647dc49e7d97.jpg",
                "alt": ""
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "highlight",
            "label": "",
            "title": "floema",
            "href": "",
            "images": [
                {
                    "src": "/floema/images/9a06b24525c5217e.jpg",
                    "alt": ""
                },
                {
                    "src": "/floema/images/85938e787054068c.jpg",
                    "alt": ""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "content",
            "side": "left",
            "label": "The Brand",
            "description": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "FLOEMA is a new jewelry brand all design and handmade by me, Valentina Caprini, goldsmith, and artist based in Florence.",
                    "spans": [
                        {
                            "start": 61,
                            "end": 78,
                            "type": "hyperlink",
                            "data": {
                                "link_type": "Web",
                                "url": "https://www.valentinacaprini.com/"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The name FLOEMA is inspired by the vascular tissue of the plants, which brings the lifeblood from the roots to the branches and makes flowers and fruits bloom.",
                    "spans": []
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Each FLOEMA piece is elegant and unique, created with a refined goldsmith’s technique in a small laboratory equipped with machines dated to the beginning of the ‘900.",
                    "spans": []
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Like the lifeblood makes the plant evolve, so FLOEMA gives part of its income to PLAN INTERNATIONAL, a charity that works hard to eliminate the child brides phenomenon.",
                    "spans": [
                        {
                            "start": 81,
                            "end": 99,
                            "type": "hyperlink",
                            "data": {
                                "link_type": "Web",
                                "url": "https://plan-international.org/srhr/child-marriage-early-forced/"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ],
            "image": {
                "src": "/floema/images/c93608b3975c7b8e.jpg",
                "alt": ""
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "gallery",
            "images": [
                {
                    "src": "/floema/images/c2960593f1d8d17e.jpg",
                    "alt": ""
                },
                {
